bLnWxFQGUTRjiHGoKY1oV5c"></div></figure>
<ol start=3D"2">
<li>
<p>Contains at least one character of a frequency greater than 1.</p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display:flex;justify-content:center"><=
img alt=3D"The image represents a sequence of characters 'a', 'b', 'c', 'b'=
