character 'a' is not found within the hash_set, the window expands.  The ar=
rows and text describe the conditional logic of the algorithm: the 'left' a=
nd 'right' pointers control the window's boundaries, and the 'hash_set' is =
used to track characters within the current window; the window expands if a=
 character is not present in the hash_set." loading=3D"lazy" width=3D"640" =
height=3D"90" decoding=3D"async" data-nimg=3D"1" style=3D"color:transparent=
